// The MCP server for the project app's agents (api/mcp.js): every tool's schema and how it runs. The data and report tools
// are read-only (annotations readOnlyHint: true, openWorldHint: true); the project tools (lib/mcp/projects.mjs) marked
// write change the team’s projects and are listed only when writes are on (PR.writesOn: a locked endpoint). A tool
// answers with compact text (lib/mcp/text.mjs); a location the agent can't be told about, a bad input or a failing
// upstream comes back as a short sentence, never a crash.
